{"b":"Ps","c":6,"v":[{"n":1,"t":"O LORD, rebuke me not in thine anger, neither chasten me in thy hot displeasure.","tags":["prayer"],"tm":{"prayer":"Addresses God directly: “O LORD”."},"x":[["Ps.38.1",9,"q"],["Jer.46.28",8,"r"],["Ps.118.18",8,"r"],["Jer.10.24",7,"w"],["1Cor.11.31",7,"r"],["1Cor.11.32",7,"r"],["Isa.57.16",6,"r"],["1Chr.15.21",6,"r"],["Isa.54.9",5,"w"],["Ps.4.1",5,"r"]]},{"n":2,"t":"Have mercy upon me, O LORD; for I am weak: O LORD, heal me; for my bones are vexed.","it":[[34,36]],"tags":["prayer"],"tm":{"prayer":"Addresses God directly: “O LORD”."},"x":[["Hos.6.1",10,"w"],["Ps.30.2",8,"r"],["Ps.31.10",8,"w"],["Jer.17.14",7,"w"],["Deut.32.39",6,"w"],["Ps.41.3",6,"r"],["Ps.41.4",6,"w"],["Ps.51.8",6,"w"],["Gen.20.17",5,"r"],["Ps.38.3",5,"w"]]},{"n":3,"t":"My soul is also sore vexed: but thou, O LORD, how long?","tags":["prayer"],"tm":{"prayer":"Addresses God directly: “O LORD”."},"x":[["Ps.90.13",7,"w"],["John.12.27",4,"r"],["Ps.38.8",2,"w"],["Ps.77.2",2,"w"],["Ps.77.3",2,"r"],["Luke.18.7",2,"w"],["Ps.22.14",2,"r"],["Prov.18.14",2,"r"],["Ps.31.9",2,"r"],["Ps.31.10",2,"r"]]},{"n":4,"t":"Return, O LORD, deliver my soul: oh save me for thy mercies’ sake.","tags":["prayer"],"tm":{"prayer":"Addresses God directly: “O LORD”."},"x":[["Dan.9.18",5,"w"],["Eph.2.7",4,"r"],["Eph.2.8",4,"r"],["Ps.17.13",4,"e"],["Ps.80.14",3,"w"],["Ps.121.7",3,"r"],["Ps.22.20",3,"w"],["Mal.3.7",3,"w"],["Ps.116.4",3,"e"],["Ps.90.13",3,"w"]]},{"n":5,"t":"For in death there is no remembrance of thee: in the grave who shall give thee thanks?","it":[[13,21]],"x":[["Ps.88.10",25,"r"],["Ps.88.12",25,"r"],["Ps.115.17",24,"r"],["Eccl.9.10",22,"w"],["Ps.30.9",19,"r"],["Isa.38.18",10,"w"],["Isa.38.19",10,"r"],["Ps.118.17",8,"r"],["John.9.4",4,"r"]]},{"n":6,"t":"I am weary with my groaning; all the night make I my bed to swim; I water my couch with my tears.","x":[["Ps.38.9",6,"w"],["Ps.69.3",6,"w"],["Ps.42.3",6,"w"],["Job.7.3",3,"r"],["Ps.77.2",3,"w"],["Ps.77.9",3,"r"],["Lam.2.11",3,"w"],["Lam.1.16",3,"w"],["Job.16.20",3,"w"],["Job.23.2",3,"w"]]},{"n":7,"t":"Mine eye is consumed because of grief; it waxeth old because of all mine enemies.","x":[["Job.17.7",4,"w"],["Ps.38.10",4,"r"],["Lam.5.17",3,"r"],["Ps.88.9",3,"w"],["Ps.31.9",2,"e"],["Ps.31.10",2,"w"],["Ps.32.3",2,"w"]]},{"n":8,"t":"Depart from me, all ye workers of iniquity; for the LORD hath heard the voice of my weeping.","tags":["nt"],"tm":{"nt":"Closely echoes Luke 13:27 (12 reader votes, OpenBible.info)."},"x":[["Luke.13.27",12,"e"],["Ps.145.18",12,"r"],["Ps.119.115",11,"w"],["Matt.7.23",9,"w"],["Ps.3.4",9,"r"],["Matt.25.41",8,"w"],["Heb.5.7",8,"r"],["Ps.139.19",7,"w"],["Ps.116.8",6,"r"],["Isa.30.19",6,"r"]]},{"n":9,"t":"The LORD hath heard my supplication; the LORD will receive my prayer.","x":[["Ps.66.19",14,"w"],["Ps.66.20",14,"w"],["Ps.120.1",13,"r"],["2Cor.12.8",8,"r"],["2Cor.12.10",8,"r"],["Ps.40.1",6,"r"],["Ps.40.2",6,"r"],["Ps.118.5",5,"r"],["Jonah.2.7",5,"w"],["Ps.138.3",5,"r"]]},{"n":10,"t":"Let all mine enemies be ashamed and sore vexed: let them return and be ashamed suddenly.","it":[[64,67]],"x":[["Jer.20.11",6,"w"],["Mal.3.18",6,"w"],["Ps.86.17",6,"w"],["Isa.26.11",4,"w"],["Ps.40.14",3,"w"],["Ps.40.15",3,"r"],["Ps.83.16",3,"r"],["Ps.83.17",3,"r"],["Ps.73.19",3,"r"],["Ps.71.13",3,"r"]]}],"title":"To the chief Musician on Neginoth upon Sheminith, A Psalm of David."}